WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Export group contacts to an Excel workbook. First, install BitNyxt and open WhatsApp Web. This walkthrough starts with the sidebar open.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
1. Select your group. Choose a group you have permission to use. Keep “Export all groups” off for one group.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
2. Refresh the preview. Click Refresh Preview to check the available export rows.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Check counts and diagnostics. Review rows, worksheets and warnings. Unavailable numbers may remain missing.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
3. Export Contacts. Return to the export controls and download the XLSX workbook.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Review your workbook. Check the Summary and contact sheets before using the data in another tool.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Try it with your own group. Get WhatsApp Contacts to Excel — BitNyxt from the Chrome Web Store.
